    "title": "Maximum Product After K Increments",
    "category": "Greedy",
    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "problemStatement": "Given an array of non-negative integers and an integer K, perform exactly K operations where each operation increments one array element by one. Determine the maximum possible product of all elements after the operations.",
